OL,3,GNEWSAHow could crashes at most bashed
OL,4,Abridge be stopped?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is a plan to stop lorries
OL,7,Fcrashing into Britain's most bashed
OL,8,Frailway bridge - but it has temporarily
OL,9,Fhit the buffers.
OL,11,FThe bridge crossing the A5 Watling
OL,12,FStreet has been struck by tall vehicles
OL,13,Fat least 33 times since March 2025,
OL,14,Faccording to Network Rail.
OL,16,FThe proposed solution to the problem,
OL,17,Fto lower the road under the bridge, was
OL,18,Fgranted planning permission in 2023,
OL,19,Fbut Network Rail has yet to sign off
OL,20,Fthe scheme in detail.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
